ind":"announcement","title":"Updates for version 1.0","summary":"Hello there,This update includes the following:Updated spider to slow down longer after being hit by spirit beads.Fixed the game creating a new save automatically in the first slot when loading save.Updated the mirror effect to be better.Thanks for playing and please let me know if you have any issues.Larry","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:51:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037416","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:15:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1846651706691303","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for build 0.9.9.20","summary":"Hello there,This build has the following changes:Removed black bars for certain interactions that aren't necessary.Added smoke detectors to various scenes.Fixed Photo Match text not typewriter printing all the time when matched.Fixed photo match text sometimes not showing up on a loaded game for first photo.Thanks!Larry","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691303","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1846651706685851","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for build 0.9.9.19","summary":"Hello there,This build contains the following:Tweaked some models and graveyard for performance and visuals in castle exterior.Updated layout of Adult Family Home spirits and masks to fit the story better.Adjusted how the home mirror handles imagery.Fixed photos sometimes not being visible on a new game.Added ghost spirit to the classroom.Updated the speed of throwing and tossing animations.Updated the lighting in the interior castle.Fixed vines that shouldn't glow green.Thanks,Larry","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:18:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1846651706682374","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for 0.9.9.17 (wayfinding and more)","summary":"Hello there,This update contains the following:Updated red spirits to be more above ground.Updated how red spirits spawn away from the player.Updated red spirit to die by prayer.Updated spiders to be more visible.Updated death particles for red spirit.Can get stuck in the middle of the red spirits spawning.Fixed background menu showing up when game starts up.Fixed intro area so it's more clear where to go.Updated photo matching to more forgiving.Updated groaning man to point the way to where to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:01:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1846018067939462","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for 0.9.9.14","summary":"Hello there,This build addresses the following:Updated how bead, stone, and prayer receivers register hits.Fixed particles for wall with spirit embedded in it.Updated button mapping for gamepads to use right shoulder for attack.Fixed cat mask requirements to unlock.Updated some ghost events to happend in different pass through castle.Moved animal mask to cave tunnel.Fixed look of end particles.Thanks!Larry","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T21:50:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939462","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1846018067934359","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for build 0.9.9.13 (Performance and more)","summary":"Hello there,This update includes the following: Reduced texture memory to help improve performance. Added ability to cancel going to next level. Title card side keeps flashing when closing the full page one Updated text titles for classroom. Fixed lady showing up over herself sometimes when finding masks. Updated ghost appearances to be more transparently ghostly. Updated charcoal body to have an animated glow to it. Added more variation and supporting text to airplane scene. Fixed issue with wa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T18:35:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934359","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1845383656379070","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for build 0.9.9.11","summary":"Hello there,This build fixes the following, relatively minor issues:Fixed difficulty saving game in slot 3Some stones lift too slow with spirit beadsFixed assessment photo for trap doorFixed intermittent issue with throw and toss animationsThanks,Larry","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T22:14:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379070","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1844751498225898","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for build 0.9.9.10","summary":"Hello there,This build addresses the following:Updated player to move a tad bit quicker so it feels less weighty. I'll keep looking into this.Removed crosshair when the camera focuses on an object.Significantly reduced the frequency of the apparition events.Updated the vines to look more like, well, vines.Updated the demo so it's clear how to finish it.Added polaroid photos in each level that have to be found first before matching.Thanks again for playing! Lemme know if there are any issues.Larr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T20:38:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4081850-1844751498219817","game_id":"steam-4081850","kind":"announcement","title":"Updates for build 0.9.9.9","summary":"Hello there,This latest update addresses the following:Fixed issue with camera seeing through garage door.Fixed issue with \"Very Good\" showing in Quality settings by default.Fixed issue seeing through doors in the home when running.Added a new \"Low\" graphics settings.Fixed issue with the mouse snapping back after looking around.Added a dedicated diary icon in the HUD (with exclamation if something was recently unlocked).Fixed issue with the assessment photos not showing in menu until initially o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T23:13:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4081850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4081850":"20